    "summary": "Tasks t1–t6 establish authenticated source staging/recovery, source selection/native ownership, installer/shell delivery and acknowledged independent updates with durable results. Task t7 routes both IDE updates through the current packaged installer, retains qualified lifecycle/MCP owners, reconstructs native child environments, and enforces qualified bootstrap material. Canonical evidence is in docs/plans/node-runtime-evidence/ide-consumers.md, including four actual OrbStack legacy/bound routing variants, stopped-profile preservation, current report wiring and closure receipts. The initial registered request was interrupted by an installed watcher/V8 crash before any verdict; the same installed build was restored through its startup guard and fixture churn moved outside the indexed repository. The relocated native matrix and merged-tree controller rebuild passed. Historical application/native/data qualification remains t9–t11; BUILD approval waits for the entire story.",
